. Holds 100,000 users and stores 500,000 card swiping records\n4. Support interlock, group combination, anti-passback, remote unlock, and more\n5. Support card reader tamper alarm, intrusion alarm, door sensor timeout alarm, duress alarm, illegal card exceeding threshold alarm, and incorrect password alarm\n6. Support fire linkage\n7. Built-in RTC, support manual  time synchronization and auto time synchronization\n8. Support power-off memory protection and online upgrade\n9. Support watchdog (a device that protects a system from software or hardware failures)\n10. Management platform: DSSPro and SmartPSS AC\n11. Support PoE power supply\n12. Applicable to industrial parks, office buildings, financial buildings, schools, factories, CBD, residential areas, governments, and more','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-07 15:05:42','2026-01-07 15:05:42'),(2298,'PROD-CDBYKJKK','DHI-ASC2202C-D','1. TCP/IP communication.\n2. Two communication protocols: RS-485 and Wiegand.\n3. Supports storing 100,000 user and 500,000 card-swiping records.\n4. Supports multi-door interlock, multi-user unlock, anti-passback, and remote unlock.\n5. Supports reader tamper alarm, intrusion alarm, unlocking timeout alarm, duress alarm, invalid card exceeding threshold alarm, and incorrect password alarm.\n6. Supports built-in RTC, manual time fixing, and automatic time fixing.\n7. Data can be saved permanently in case of power failure; supports online upgrade.\n8. Power supply through storage battery(Default does not include storage battery, and the reserved storage battery space is 153.5mm*117.45mm*75mm).\n9. Supports watchdog mechanism to ensure the operation stability.\n10. Compatible with DSS Pro and SmartPSS AC.\n11. Applicable to parks, high-end office buildings, financial buildings, insurance buildings, schools, factories, venues, CBD business centers, high-end residential areas, high-level government departments, maritime safety bureaus, etc.','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,