ower is off.\nMCBF ≥ 3 million times.\nWhen receiving fire alarm signals, the turnstile will be normally open; and the turnstile can output alarm signals.\n9 passing modes: Pass with identity verified, not allowed to pass, and pass without restrictions.\nSupports integration of face, fingerprint, QR code, CPU card, ID card reader module and more to achieve a combination of multiple authentication methods.','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-07 15:05:43','2026-01-07 15:05:43'),(2407,'PROD-LFMYSMNU','DHI-ASGG500T','Tripod turnstile case that is built of 304 stainless steel with a thickness of 1.5 mm.\nThe cabinet case works with the ASGG520T arm model. (Tripod arms and motor are not included.)','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-07 15:05:43','2026-01-07 15:05:43'),(2408,'PROD-MJIA3QPL','DHI-ASGQ220C','Constructed from robust 304 stainless steel, it features a cabinet with a thickness of 1.2 mm (0.05\"), a main shaft that is 2.8 mm (0.11\") thick, and each bar in the barrier with a thickness of 0.9 mm (0.04\"). \nMCBF (Mean Cycles between Failures) is no less than 3 million times.\nThe passage width is 600 mm (23.62\") and the device can flexibly perform unidirectional or bidirectional operations.\nEngineered to prevent people from jumping over the barrier and tailgating, the device ensures that only one person can pass through each barrier at a time.\nSupports normally opening the fire passage.\nDesigned to allow only one person to pass at a time to ensure the safety and security of each individual.\nSupports second authentication, and memorizing passing data for entry and exit.\nIncludes card reader boards and access controller boards and supports being connected to access controllers. You can combine different modules for more options.','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-07 15:05:43','2026-01-07 15:05:43'),(2409,'PROD-ANZJZJYZ','DHI-ASGQ520C','Constructed from robust 304 stainless steel, it features a cabinet with a thickness of 1.2 mm (0.05\"), a main shaft that is 2.8 mm (0.11\") thick, and each bar in the barrier with a thickness of 0.9 mm (0.04\"). \nMCBF (Mean Cycles between Failures) is no less than 3 million times.\nThe passage width is 600 mm (23.62\") and the device can flexibly perform unidirectional or bidirectional operations.\nEngineered to prevent people from jumping over the barrier and tailgating, the device ensures that only one person can pass through each barrier at a time.\nSupports normally opening the fire passage.\nDesigned to allow only one person to pass at a time to ensure the safety and security of each individual.\nSupports second authentication, and memorizing passing data for entry and exit.\nIncludes card reader boards and access controller boards and supports being connected to access controllers. You can combine different modules for more options.','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-07 15:05:43','2026-01-07 15:05:43'),(2410,'PROD-YQHI6FXE','ASGHoleCover002','Domestic General Gate Spare Parts','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-07 15:05:43','2026-01-07 15:05:43'),(2411,'PROD-WGG4ECPS','DHI-ASGF001R','Encrypts transmissions to ensure information is securely and efficiently received.\nRemotely controls the turnstile, offering various unlock methods for added convenience.\nSupports one-to-one and one-to-many code matching, and each receiver can be paired with up to 32 transmitters.','Dahua','Caja','Caja',NULL,6,1,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-07 15:05:43','2026-01-07 15:05:43'),(2412,'PROD-5YEKIXMB','DHI-ASGF002S','Encrypts transmissions to ensure information is securely and efficiently transferred.\nRemotely controls the turnstile, offering various unlock methods for added convenience.\nIncludes 1 pair of AAA batteries.\nSupports one-to-one and one-to-many code matching, and each transmitter can be paired with up to 32 receivers.\nIncludes an indicator light that flashes green when you press a button on the transmitter and the command is successf